{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>A wild ass of a man.</b> A lover of the wildernesses, to hunt wild animals — as written: ״וַיֵּשֶׁב בַּמִּדְבָּר וַיְהִי רֹבֵה קַשָּׁת״ (Genesis 21)." "<b>His hand against all.</b> Highwaymen." "<b>And the hand of all against him.</b> All hate him and make war against him." "<b>And over against all his brethren he shall dwell.</b> That his seed shall be great (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:57.829522915Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}